img/photos/south-shore.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/south-shore-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/south-shore.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Islip</b><small>Suffolk County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/white-plains/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/westchester.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/westchester-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/westchester.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>White Plains</b><small>Westchester County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/albany/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/albany.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/albany-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/albany.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Albany</b><small>Albany County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/syracuse/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/syracuse.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/syracuse-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/syracuse.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Syracuse</b><small>Onondaga County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/rochester/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/rochester.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/rochester-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/rochester.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Rochester</b><small>Monroe County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/buffalo/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/buffalo.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/buffalo-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/buffalo.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Buffalo</b><small>Erie County</small></span></a><a class="loc rv" href="/where-we-appraise/binghamton/"><img src="/assets/img/photos/binghamton.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/binghamton-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/binghamton.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 50vw, 25vw" width="1024" height="680" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><span class="loc-b"><b>Binghamton</b><small>Broome County</small></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec tint"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head left rv"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims change across the state</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently in a Tribeca loft, a Levittown cape and a Buffalo double.</p></div><div class="reg-list"><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/manhattan.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/manhattan-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/manhattan.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>New York City</h3><p class="muted">Five boroughs</p><p>Co-ops, condos, brownstones and attached brick homes put two or three policies on every loss. A burst riser in a pre-war co-op or a fire next door in a Brooklyn row means sorting the board’s master policy from your own before anyone can price the damage.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/manhattan/">Manhattan</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/brooklyn/">Brooklyn</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/queens/">Queens</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/staten-island/">Staten Island</a></p></div></div><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/long-island.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/long-island-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/long-island.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="658" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>Long Island</h3><p class="muted">Nassau &amp; Suffolk</p><p>South Shore communities still measure storms against Sandy. Percentage hurricane deductibles, wind-versus-flood questions and big oaks over capes and high-ranches drive most of the disputes we see east of the city line.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/hempstead/">Hempstead</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/islip/">Islip</a></p></div></div><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/westchester.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/westchester-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/westchester.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>Hudson Valley &amp; Westchester</h3><p class="muted">From Yonkers to Kingston</p><p>Leafy suburbs mean limbs on roofs. Summer squall lines, the occasional tornado and cloudburst flooding like the remnants of Ida leave older colonials and Tudors with layered roofs, finished basements and complicated scopes.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/white-plains/">White Plains</a></p></div></div><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/albany.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/albany-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/albany.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="768" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>Capital Region &amp; North Country</h3><p class="muted">Albany to the St. Lawrence</p><p>Freeze–thaw cycles do quiet, expensive damage to Albany brick rowhouses and Adirondack camps alike. Ice dams, burst pipes in vacant seasonal homes and ice-loaded trees are the claims winter leaves behind.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/albany/">Albany</a></p></div></div><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/syracuse.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/syracuse-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/syracuse.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="960" height="640" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>Central NY &amp; Finger Lakes</h3><p class="muted">Syracuse · Rochester</p><p>Some of the snowiest large cities in the country sit along the Thruway. Heavy, wet lake-effect loads stress older wood-frame roofs, and summer derechos like the 1998 Labor Day storm show how fast wind claims pile up.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/syracuse/">Syracuse</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/rochester/">Rochester</a></p></div></div><div class="reg-row rv"><span class="reg-ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/buffalo.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/buffalo-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/buffalo.webp 1024w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 280px" width="1024" height="683" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><div><h3>Western NY &amp; Southern Tier</h3><p class="muted">Buffalo · Binghamton</p><p>Buffalo doubles under multi-foot lake-effect snow and Southern Tier homes along the Susquehanna share one thing: losses where cause matters. Separating covered snow, ice and wind damage from excluded flooding is often the whole dispute.</p><p class="rp-links"><a href="/where-we-appraise/buffalo/">Buffalo</a> <a href="/where-we-appraise/binghamton/">Binghamton</a></p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap"><div><h2>Don’t see your town?</h2><p>We cover every county in New York. Call and tell us where the property is.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-orange" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-ghost-l" href="/reach-us/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
